  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cook rice: Fill a medium saucepan three-quarters full with water and bring to the boil. Add the rice and cook for 25-27 mins until tender. Drain.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1164274/photos/large/208973_1-09321be7fe37b77486d2386a6da7a5af.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook veggie patties: Meanwhile, scatter half the Turkish seasoning over both sides of the veggie patties. Heat 1 tbs olive oil in a medium frypan over medium heat. Cook the veggie patties for 4-5 mins each side until golden and warmed through (see Kitchen 101). Remove from the pan and keep warm.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1164275/photos/large/208973_2-7afbb2227c42bca63a354134666bbe8d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shred carrot: While the patties are cooking, shred the carrot using a julienne peeler or coarsely grate with a box grater.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1164276/photos/large/208973_3-96217ba0ad50bb1adc01009dab4dd5bd.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make hummus dressing: Combine the hummus, remaining Turkish seasoning, 1 tsp turmeric, 1 tsp white wine vinegar and 1 tbs water in a bowl and season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1164277/photos/large/208973_4-7bc3b35d951c4e5fb952c32174a813f6.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Cut the veggie patties into quarters. Divide the rice, carrot, spinach and veggie patties among bowls. Drizzle with the hummus dressing and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1164278/photos/large/208973_5-bff7eb81f29708afed13f4f6f938c0b0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Kitchen 101: The veggie patties look robust, but they actually love to be handled with care. Be gentle when turning the patties during cooking to ensure they don't break.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/1164279/photos/large/208973_6-4d3c4ea95a44ac58d930ae51740a309c.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
